    Maximum quality: opus for architecture, planning & verification phases
  ( ) economy
    Cost-optimised: sonnet for all phases, haiku for archiving
  ( ) diversity
    Diversity: Opus for Judge A, Haiku for Judge B, Sonnet for fixes
